# S-050 nvenc DEFECT D-2: nvenc_check() passes config_get_string(..., "driver_ver") straight to
# sscanf. A document that is "supported" but lacks driver_ver crashes the reference (NULL
# dereference in sscanf). Required behaviour: treat as driver version 0.0 (split encoding then
# counts as broken). The reference result is recorded as a crash in a forked child.
ini "[general]\nnvenc_supported=true\nnvenc_devices=1\nnvenc_ver=13.0\ncuda_ver=12.0\n"
fsupported
